{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LrBX8i8j431793615504.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產馬鞍山迎海御峰分行資深區域營業經理胡耀祖表示，一手帶動下，整體二手交投氣氛向好，部份向隅客開始回流二手市場，西沙大型屋苑Sierra sea本月錄約6宗二手成交，屋苑最新錄1A(2)期1座高層G室，實用面積305平方呎，1房間隔，開價約538萬元，議價後以485萬元易手，實用平均呎價15,902元。</p><p> </p><p>中原胡耀祖指，新買家為上車客，見單位間隔合用，價錢合理，即決定入市單位自用。據了解，原業主於2025年以403.7萬元購入單位，持貨約1年多，是次轉手賬面上獲利81.3萬元或20.1%離場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:54.215688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":250,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T09:39:14.167835+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:18:17.016086+00:00","content_hash":"239aefde60d837100f65f6496320267f06c6dcfd1845b14f965e8dc801f0042d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:20:54.215688+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}